repository-code: https://github.com/mdmasrurhr/diamond-strain-pinn
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
abstract: >-
  Code and data for predicting the bandgap of strained diamond from the
  six-component Green-Lagrange strain tensor. The dataset holds 1,292
  deformation states computed with hybrid-functional DFT. The models combine
  neural networks with deformation-potential and Bir-Pikus models of the band
  edges. The repository contains one standalone script per model of the paper
  (proposed hybrid model PHM, residual model, APHYNITY, SA-PINN, RBA-PINN,
  NTK-PINN, MLP, conventional regression, analytic models alone), the commands
  of all 2,924 training runs, the fitted constants of the analytic models,
  condensed results of every run, and the analysis that recomputes every
  table, number, statistical test and figure of the paper.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural network
  - hybrid model
  - machine learning
  - diamond
  - bandgap
  - strain engineering
  - density functional theory
  - deformation potential
